<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- Store P and L Statement: the paginated drill target behind the worst-stores
     list on the Store Profit and Budget cockpit. One store, one month, actual
     against a chosen budget version, in statement order.

     PARAMETER TYPES - p_store is java.lang.Integer, NOT String. The calling tile
     (pnl_worst_stores.jrxml) passes $F{storenumber}, an Integer field, through a
     ReportExecution hyperlinkParameter, so a String parameter would fail the drill
     on a type mismatch. The store column is compared directly rather than through
     INT4(...). p_yyyymm and p_version stay String because the shared input controls
     feed them string values.

     DEVIATIONS from the task brief, all verified in the warehouse first:

     1. Line 8 is a residual, not a subtraction of named cost columns. Four-wall
        EBITDA is gross margin less total store opex PLUS promotional subsidy
        income, and the budget-vs-actual source carries no subsidy column. Deriving
        line 8 as (EBITDA - gross margin + labour + occupancy + utilities +
        shrinkage) makes the statement foot to the cent on both the actual and the
        budget side; the brief's literal formula left the subsidy out and missed
        four-wall EBITDA by that amount (2,167.20 for the default store/month).
        The line is therefore labelled "net of subsidy".

     2. Variance percent divides by ABS(budget), not budget. Cost lines are carried
        negative, so dividing by the signed budget flipped the percent's sign
        against the variance amount on every cost line - a favourable 928.80 on
        labour read as +9.0 percent only by accident of two negatives. With the
        absolute denominator, positive always means favourable on every line, which
        is what the brief's own note ("the variance sign is always
        favourable-positive") asks for, and it lets one sign test colour both the
        amount and the percent. The percent is left as the raw FLOAT8 quotient
        (field class java.lang.Double) and NOT re-cast to DECIMAL(..., 8, 1):
        that cast TRUNCATES the scale rather than rounding, so every displayed
        tenth could read 0.1pp low (labour 9.065 printed 9.0, shrinkage -41.59
        printed -41.5). The pattern="#,##0.0'%'" does the rounding at render
        time instead.

     3. The inline per-row variance bar is a summary-band chart. JR7 has no
        expression-driven element width, so a per-row rectangle cannot be scaled;
        the plan already documents this deviation. The bar chart carries all eleven
        lines with the favourable/unfavourable sign split used on the cockpit.

     4. Chart sizes differ from the brief's 500x160 and 300x260: 500 + 300 exceeds
        the 782px column width of an A4 landscape page at 30px margins, so the pair
        is laid out 430 + 340 at a common height.

     5. The regional rank chip is suppressed when the store has no four-wall
        margin for the month. The brief's rank counts stores strictly better than
        this one, and a NULL margin (a store with no sales that month, which is
        exactly what the worst-stores drill often lands on) loses every comparison,
        so the store would be announced as rank #1 in its region. The chip is
        replaced with a plain "no sales recorded" sentence in that case.

     6. The variance bar's two sign series return a zero, not null, for a
        non-matching sign. A null is NOT registered in the category dataset, so the
        series that happens to carry the FIRST row's value is registered first and
        takes seriesColor order="0". With a null, the colours therefore invert
        whenever net sales misses budget: rendering store 531 for 2020-12 put every
        unfavourable line in favourable blue. A zero registers both series at the
        first category in declaration order, pins order 0 to Favourable, and draws
        a zero-length (invisible) bar, so nothing changes visually. Verified by
        re-rendering both a favourable-first and an unfavourable-first store.
        The same latent inversion exists in pnl_variance_region.jrxml and
        pnl_waterfall.jrxml, which use the null form.

     7. The variance-percent cells are blankWhenNull. A zero budget line divides
        by NULLIF(...) and yields NULL, which otherwise prints the literal text
        "null" - seen on a store whose whole month was budgeted at zero.

     8. The twelve-month strip uses yyyymm BETWEEN p_yyyymm - 99 AND p_yyyymm.
        The brief's -100 spans thirteen months (the prior December through the
        chosen month); -99 yields exactly the twelve points the acceptance check
        asks for, for any month of the year.

     JR7-native throughout: <query language="SQL">, <element kind="...">,
     <dataset kind="category">, repeated <seriesColor order="n"/>, sub-dataset as a
     top-level <dataset name="..."> driven by <datasetRun subDataset="...">.
     Conditional bold on total lines is a <conditionalStyle>; the variance colour
     is two overlapping textFields with printWhenExpression, per the brief. The
     charts sit in the summary band, which fills after the last record, so no
     evaluationTime override is needed there - the subtitle does need
     evaluationTime="Report" because it reads a field from the title band. -->
<jasperReport name="rpt_store_pnl_statement" language="java" pageWidth="842" pageHeight="595" orientation="Landscape" columnWidth="782" leftMargin="30" rightMargin="30" topMargin="30" bottomMargin="30" whenNoDataType="AllSectionsNoDetail">

	<style name="stmt_label" fontSize="10.0" forecolor="#1F4E79">
		<conditionalStyle bold="true">
			<conditionExpression><![CDATA[$F{is_total} != null && $F{is_total}.intValue() == 1]]></conditionExpression>
		</conditionalStyle>
	</style>
	<style name="stmt_amount" fontSize="10.0" forecolor="#1F4E79">
		<conditionalStyle bold="true">
			<conditionExpression><![CDATA[$F{is_total} != null && $F{is_total}.intValue() == 1]]></conditionExpression>
		</conditionalStyle>
	</style>

	<dataset name="ds_ebitda_trend">
		<parameter name="p_store" class="java.lang.Integer"/>
		<parameter name="p_yyyymm" class="java.lang.String"/>
		<query language="SQL"><![CDATA[
SELECT yyyymm, CAST(yyyymm AS VARCHAR(6)) AS ym, DECIMAL(four_wall_ebitda, 14, 2) AS four_wall_ebitda
FROM store_pnl_monthly
WHERE storenumber = $P{p_store} AND yyyymm BETWEEN INT4($P{p_yyyymm}) - 99 AND INT4($P{p_yyyymm})
ORDER BY yyyymm
		]]></query>
		<field name="yyyymm" class="java.lang.Integer"/>
		<field name="ym" class="java.lang.String"/>
		<field name="four_wall_ebitda" class="java.math.BigDecimal"/>
	</dataset>

	<parameter name="p_store" class="java.lang.Integer"><defaultValueExpression><![CDATA[Integer.valueOf(2)]]></defaultValueExpression></parameter>
	<parameter name="p_yyyymm" class="java.lang.String"><defaultValueExpression><![CDATA["202012"]]></defaultValueExpression></parameter>
	<parameter name="p_version" class="java.lang.String"><defaultValueExpression><![CDATA["Original"]]></defaultValueExpression></parameter>

	<query language="SQL"><![CDATA[
SELECT s.line_order, s.line_label,
       DECIMAL(s.actual_amt, 14, 2) AS actual_amt,
       DECIMAL(s.budget_amt, 14, 2) AS budget_amt,
       DECIMAL(s.actual_amt - s.budget_amt, 14, 2) AS variance_amt,
       100.0 * FLOAT8(s.actual_amt - s.budget_amt) / FLOAT8(NULLIF(ABS(s.budget_amt), 0)) AS variance_pct,
       s.is_total,
       (SELECT storename FROM stores WHERE storenumber = $P{p_store}) AS storename,
       (SELECT region FROM stores WHERE storenumber = $P{p_store}) AS region,
       (SELECT INT4(COUNT(*) + 1) FROM store_pnl_monthly q WHERE q.yyyymm = INT4($P{p_yyyymm}) AND q.region = (SELECT region FROM stores WHERE storenumber = $P{p_store}) AND q.four_wall_margin_pct > (SELECT four_wall_margin_pct FROM store_pnl_monthly r WHERE r.storenumber = $P{p_store} AND r.yyyymm = INT4($P{p_yyyymm}))) AS region_rank,
       (SELECT INT4(COUNT(*)) FROM store_pnl_monthly n WHERE n.yyyymm = INT4($P{p_yyyymm}) AND n.region = (SELECT region FROM stores WHERE storenumber = $P{p_store})) AS region_n,
       (SELECT DECIMAL(m.four_wall_margin_pct, 8, 2) FROM store_pnl_monthly m WHERE m.storenumber = $P{p_store} AND m.yyyymm = INT4($P{p_yyyymm})) AS own_margin_pct
FROM (
  SELECT 1 AS line_order, CAST('Net sales' AS VARCHAR(40)) AS line_label, actual_net_sales AS actual_amt, budget_net_sales AS budget_amt, 0 AS is_total FROM store_budget_vs_actual WHERE storenumber = $P{p_store} AND yyyymm = INT4($P{p_yyyymm}) AND budget_version = $P{p_version}
  UNION ALL SELECT 2, 'Cost of goods sold', -(actual_net_sales - actual_gross_margin), -(budget_net_sales - budget_gross_margin), 0 FROM store_budget_vs_actual WHERE storenumber = $P{p_store} AND yyyymm = INT4($P{p_yyyymm}) AND budget_version = $P{p_version}
  UNION ALL SELECT 3, 'Gross margin', actual_gross_margin, budget_gross_margin, 1 FROM store_budget_vs_actual WHERE storenumber = $P{p_store} AND yyyymm = INT4($P{p_yyyymm}) AND budget_version = $P{p_version}
  UNION ALL SELECT 4, 'Labour (loaded)', -actual_labour_cost, -budget_labour_cost, 0 FROM store_budget_vs_actual WHERE storenumber = $P{p_store} AND yyyymm = INT4($P{p_yyyymm}) AND budget_version = $P{p_version}
  UNION ALL SELECT 5, 'Occupancy', -actual_occupancy_cost, -budget_occupancy_cost, 0 FROM store_budget_vs_actual WHERE storenumber = $P{p_store} AND yyyymm = INT4($P{p_yyyymm}) AND budget_version = $P{p_version}
  UNION ALL SELECT 6, 'Utilities', -actual_utilities_cost, -budget_utilities_cost, 0 FROM store_budget_vs_actual WHERE storenumber = $P{p_store} AND yyyymm = INT4($P{p_yyyymm}) AND budget_version = $P{p_version}
  UNION ALL SELECT 7, 'Shrinkage', -actual_shrinkage_cost, -budget_shrinkage_cost, 0 FROM store_budget_vs_actual WHERE storenumber = $P{p_store} AND yyyymm = INT4($P{p_yyyymm}) AND budget_version = $P{p_version}
  UNION ALL SELECT 8, 'Other store opex (net of subsidy)', actual_four_wall_ebitda - actual_gross_margin + actual_labour_cost + actual_occupancy_cost + actual_utilities_cost + actual_shrinkage_cost, budget_four_wall_ebitda - budget_gross_margin + budget_labour_cost + budget_occupancy_cost + budget_utilities_cost + budget_shrinkage_cost, 0 FROM store_budget_vs_actual WHERE storenumber = $P{p_store} AND yyyymm = INT4($P{p_yyyymm}) AND budget_version = $P{p_version}
  UNION ALL SELECT 9, 'Four-wall EBITDA', actual_four_wall_ebitda, budget_four_wall_ebitda, 1 FROM store_budget_vs_actual WHERE storenumber = $P{p_store} AND yyyymm = INT4($P{p_yyyymm}) AND budget_version = $P{p_version}
  UNION ALL SELECT 10, 'Franchise fees', -actual_franchise_fees, -budget_franchise_fees, 0 FROM store_budget_vs_actual WHERE storenumber = $P{p_store} AND yyyymm = INT4($P{p_yyyymm}) AND budget_version = $P{p_version}
  UNION ALL SELECT 11, 'Store contribution', actual_store_contribution, budget_store_contribution, 1 FROM store_budget_vs_actual WHERE storenumber = $P{p_store} AND yyyymm = INT4($P{p_yyyymm}) AND budget_version = $P{p_version}
) s ORDER BY s.line_order
	]]></query>

	<field name="line_order" class="java.lang.Integer"/>
	<field name="line_label" class="java.lang.String"/>
	<field name="actual_amt" class="java.math.BigDecimal"/>
	<field name="budget_amt" class="java.math.BigDecimal"/>
	<field name="variance_amt" class="java.math.BigDecimal"/>
	<field name="variance_pct" class="java.lang.Double"/>
	<field name="is_total" class="java.lang.Integer"/>
	<field name="storename" class="java.lang.String"/>
	<field name="region" class="java.lang.String"/>
	<field name="region_rank" class="java.lang.Integer"/>
	<field name="region_n" class="java.lang.Integer"/>
	<field name="own_margin_pct" class="java.math.BigDecimal"/>

	<title height="56">
		<element kind="image" x="0" y="0" width="44" height="44" scaleImage="RetainShape" hImageAlign="Left" vImageAlign="Top"><expression><![CDATA["repo:/images/actian_logo"]]></expression></element>
		<element kind="staticText" x="0" y="0" width="782" height="24" fontSize="16.0" bold="true" forecolor="#1F4E79" hTextAlign="Center"><text><![CDATA[Store P and L Statement]]></text></element>
		<element kind="textField" x="0" y="26" width="782" height="14" fontSize="9.0" forecolor="#5B7DA6" hTextAlign="Center" evaluationTime="Report">
			<expression><![CDATA[$P{p_store} + " " + $F{storename} + " - "
+ new String[]{"","January","February","March","April","May","June","July","August","September","October","November","December"}[Integer.parseInt($P{p_yyyymm}.substring(4))]
+ " " + $P{p_yyyymm}.substring(0, 4) + " - actual against the " + $P{p_version} + " budget (CAD)"]]></expression>
		</element>
		<element kind="line" x="0" y="50" width="782" height="1" forecolor="#D6E0EF"/>
	</title>

	<columnHeader height="20">
		<element kind="rectangle" x="0" y="0" width="782" height="20" mode="Opaque" backcolor="#1F4E79" forecolor="#1F4E79"/>
		<element kind="staticText" x="6" y="0" width="274" height="20" fontSize="10.0" bold="true" forecolor="#FFFFFF" vTextAlign="Middle"><text><![CDATA[Line]]></text></element>
		<element kind="staticText" x="284" y="0" width="120" height="20" fontSize="10.0" bold="true" forecolor="#FFFFFF" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle"><text><![CDATA[Actual]]></text></element>
		<element kind="staticText" x="408" y="0" width="120" height="20" fontSize="10.0" bold="true" forecolor="#FFFFFF" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle"><text><![CDATA[Budget]]></text></element>
		<element kind="staticText" x="532" y="0" width="120" height="20" fontSize="10.0" bold="true" forecolor="#FFFFFF" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle"><text><![CDATA[Variance]]></text></element>
		<element kind="staticText" x="656" y="0" width="120" height="20" fontSize="10.0" bold="true" forecolor="#FFFFFF" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle"><text><![CDATA[Variance %]]></text></element>
	</columnHeader>

	<detail>
		<band height="18">
			<element kind="rectangle" x="0" y="0" width="782" height="18" mode="Opaque" backcolor="#D6E0EF" forecolor="#D6E0EF">
				<printWhenExpression><![CDATA[$V{REPORT_COUNT}.intValue() % 2 == 0]]></printWhenExpression>
			</element>
			<element kind="line" x="0" y="0" width="782" height="1" forecolor="#1F4E79">
				<printWhenExpression><![CDATA[$F{is_total} != null && $F{is_total}.intValue() == 1]]></printWhenExpression>
			</element>
			<element kind="textField" style="stmt_label" x="6" y="0" width="274" height="18" vTextAlign="Middle"><expression><![CDATA[$F{line_label}]]></expression></element>
			<element kind="textField" style="stmt_amount" x="284" y="0" width="120" height="18" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle" pattern="$#,##0;($#,##0)"><expression><![CDATA[$F{actual_amt}]]></expression></element>
			<element kind="textField" style="stmt_amount" x="408" y="0" width="120" height="18" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle" pattern="$#,##0;($#,##0)"><expression><![CDATA[$F{budget_amt}]]></expression></element>

			<element kind="textField" style="stmt_amount" x="532" y="0" width="120" height="18" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle" forecolor="#5CB85C" pattern="$#,##0;($#,##0)">
				<expression><![CDATA[$F{variance_amt}]]></expression>
				<printWhenExpression><![CDATA[$F{variance_amt} == null || $F{variance_amt}.signum() >= 0]]></printWhenExpression>
			</element>
			<element kind="textField" style="stmt_amount" x="532" y="0" width="120" height="18" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle" forecolor="#D9534F" pattern="$#,##0;($#,##0)">
				<expression><![CDATA[$F{variance_amt}]]></expression>
				<printWhenExpression><![CDATA[$F{variance_amt} != null && $F{variance_amt}.signum() < 0]]></printWhenExpression>
			</element>

			<element kind="textField" style="stmt_amount" x="656" y="0" width="120" height="18" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle" forecolor="#5CB85C" pattern="#,##0.0'%'" blankWhenNull="true">
				<expression><![CDATA[$F{variance_pct}]]></expression>
				<printWhenExpression><![CDATA[$F{variance_amt} == null || $F{variance_amt}.signum() >= 0]]></printWhenExpression>
			</element>
			<element kind="textField" style="stmt_amount" x="656" y="0" width="120" height="18" hTextAlign="Right" vTextAlign="Middle" forecolor="#D9534F" pattern="#,##0.0'%'" blankWhenNull="true">
				<expression><![CDATA[$F{variance_pct}]]></expression>
				<printWhenExpression><![CDATA[$F{variance_amt} != null && $F{variance_amt}.signum() < 0]]></printWhenExpression>
			</element>
		</band>
	</detail>

	<summary height="258">
		<element kind="textField" x="0" y="6" width="782" height="16" fontSize="10.0" forecolor="#5B7DA6" hTextAlign="Center">
			<expression><![CDATA["Rank #" + $F{region_rank} + " of " + $F{region_n} + " stores in the " + $F{region} + " region on four-wall margin this month"]]></expression>
			<printWhenExpression><![CDATA[$F{own_margin_pct} != null]]></printWhenExpression>
		</element>
		<element kind="textField" x="0" y="6" width="782" height="16" fontSize="10.0" forecolor="#5B7DA6" hTextAlign="Center">
			<expression><![CDATA["No sales recorded for this store in this month -- regional rank on four-wall margin does not apply"]]></expression>
			<printWhenExpression><![CDATA[$F{own_margin_pct} == null]]></printWhenExpression>
		</element>
		<element kind="line" x="0" y="26" width="782" height="1" forecolor="#D6E0EF"/>
		<element kind="staticText" x="0" y="30" width="430" height="12" fontSize="9.0" forecolor="#5B7DA6" hTextAlign="Center"><text><![CDATA[Variance to budget by line, percent of budget -- favourable in blue, unfavourable in teal]]></text></element>
		<element kind="staticText" x="442" y="30" width="340" height="12" fontSize="9.0" forecolor="#5B7DA6" hTextAlign="Center"><text><![CDATA[Four-wall EBITDA, trailing twelve months (CAD)]]></text></element>

		<element kind="chart" chartType="bar" x="0" y="44" width="430" height="212" showLegend="false">
			<dataset kind="category">
				<series>
					<seriesExpression><![CDATA["Favourable"]]></seriesExpression>
					<categoryExpression><![CDATA[$F{line_order}.intValue() == 8 ? "Other store opex" : $F{line_label}]]></categoryExpression>
					<valueExpression><![CDATA[$F{variance_pct} != null && $F{variance_pct}.doubleValue() >= 0 ? $F{variance_pct} : Double.valueOf(0)]]></valueExpression>
				</series>
				<series>
					<seriesExpression><![CDATA["Unfavourable"]]></seriesExpression>
					<categoryExpression><![CDATA[$F{line_order}.intValue() == 8 ? "Other store opex" : $F{line_label}]]></categoryExpression>
					<valueExpression><![CDATA[$F{variance_pct} != null && $F{variance_pct}.doubleValue() < 0 ? $F{variance_pct} : Double.valueOf(0)]]></valueExpression>
				</series>
			</dataset>
			<plot orientation="Horizontal" showTickMarks="true" showTickLabels="true" showLabels="false">
				<seriesColor order="0" color="#0550DC"/>
				<seriesColor order="1" color="#239CA8"/>
			</plot>
		</element>

		<element kind="chart" chartType="line" x="442" y="44" width="340" height="212" showLegend="false">
			<dataset kind="category">
				<datasetRun subDataset="ds_ebitda_trend">
					<parameter name="p_store"><expression><![CDATA[$P{p_store}]]></expression></parameter>
					<parameter name="p_yyyymm"><expression><![CDATA[$P{p_yyyymm}]]></expression></parameter>
				</datasetRun>
				<series>
					<seriesExpression><![CDATA["Four-wall EBITDA"]]></seriesExpression>
					<categoryExpression><![CDATA[$F{ym}]]></categoryExpression>
					<valueExpression><![CDATA[$F{four_wall_ebitda}]]></valueExpression>
				</series>
			</dataset>
			<plot showLines="true" showShapes="true" categoryAxisTickLabelRotation="-45">
				<seriesColor order="0" color="#0550DC"/>
			</plot>
		</element>
	</summary>

</jasperReport>
